# Track analysis note figure PDFs (Studies/ plots referenced by AnalysisNote/)
!Studies/PreliminaryResult/2026-02-17_thrust_iter5/pwflag_kinematics/*.pdf
!Studies/PreliminaryResult/2026-02-17_thrust_iter5/summary/*.pdf
!Studies/PreliminaryResult/2026-02-17_thrust_iter5/summary/matrices_nominal_iter5/*.pdf
!Studies/PreliminaryResult/2026-02-17_thrust_iter5/validation/iteration_scan/*.pdf
